        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CBN750ACHSBR, Acrylic Furniture Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hand Chiseled Acrylic Furniture Pull is available in 5 inch, 7 inch, and 9 inch lengths. This unique beauty is a great addition to dressers, armoires, and light-weight closet doors. It comes with thru-bolts for a 3/4 inch thick door--which means it can be used all over the house. You can even use it as a cabinet pull. The Clearwater Furniture Pull has solid brass mounts that are available in a huge selection of finishes. Choose from traditional or modern colors to match you home decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Acrylic Cabinet Collection Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Hand Chiseled Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mount Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thru-Bolts</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-CBN03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262332\"><b>First Impressions CBN750ACHSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CBN750005ACHSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CBN750007ACHSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CBN750009ACHSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1.57\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: .85\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Clearwater Furniture Pull",
                "description": "The Hand Chiseled Acrylic Furniture Pull is available in 5 inch, 7 inch, and 9 inch lengths. This unique beauty is a great addition to dressers, armoires, and light-weight closet doors. It comes with thru-bolts for a 3/4 inch thick door--which means it can be used all over the house. You can even use it as a cabinet pull. The Clearwater Furniture Pull has solid brass mounts that are available in a huge selection of finishes. Choose from traditional or modern colors to match you home decor. \r\n",
